Spela is a Linux gaming optimization tool that combines DLSS/DLL management with comprehensive gaming environment setup.

Usage:
  spela [command] [flags]
  spela [command]

Available Commands:
  completion    Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  config        Manage global configuration
  cpu           CPU tuning and information
  denylist      Manage the DLL swap deny list
  dll           Manage game DLLs
  dlss          Configure DLSS settings
  gpu           GPU tuning and information
  help          Help about any command
  launch        Launch a game with its profile
  list          List detected games
  overlay       Overlay profile settings
  profile       Manage game profiles
  proton        Proton profile settings
  scan          Scan Steam libraries for games
  show          Show game details
  tui           Launch interactive TUI

Flags:
  -h, --help      help for spela
  -v, --version   version for spela

Use "spela [command] --help" for more information about a command.
